      en: ["Why did Freeport pay about 70% in cash rather than offering more shares? Use the signalling and ownership arguments from Section 3.4.", "Why was a bridge commitment needed at signing, who paid for it, and why was it never drawn?", "Why did the debt come before closing and the equity after it? What would have been the risk of the reverse order?", "Work through the mandatory convertible: what does an investor receive at FCX prices of $50, $67 and $90 on the conversion date? Why did rating agencies treat it as mostly equity?", "Estimate Freeport's debt after the equity take-out, ignoring free cash flow. How does this help explain the move to investment grade?", "List every role JPMorgan and Merrill Lynch played. Where could conflicts arise, and which controls described in the case address them?"],
